# The ACME challenge webroot.
#
# docker-compose.prod.yml bind-mounts this directory into nginx at
# /var/www/acme, and nginx serves ^~ /.well-known/acme-challenge/ from it.
# certbot writes challenge files here during a webroot renewal.
#
# It has to exist in a fresh checkout. Docker would otherwise create it as
# an empty root-owned directory on first `up`, which happens to work and
# hides the fact that a load-bearing path is not version controlled — until
# somebody deploys somewhere the implicit creation does not happen.
#
# Challenge files themselves are transient and must never be committed;
# .gitignore excludes everything here except this file.
